@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071

### Chat with the Repo Digest agent
POST {{baseUrl}}/agents/main/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Create a concise repo digest for Azure/azure-functions-host for the last 24 hours."
}

### Ask about a different repository
POST {{baseUrl}}/agents/main/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "What pull requests were merged in Azure/azure-functions-python-worker in the last 48 hours?"
}

### Open the built-in debug chat UI in a browser
GET {{baseUrl}}/agents/main/
